bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row mb-5\">\n            <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n                    <b>Features</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n                    List main features of your project in this block\n                </h5>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image mb-4 col-12 col-md-6\">\n                <div class=\"shadow bg-add1 item-wrapper align-center p-2 h-100\">\n                    <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\"><b>Trainees have a snow grasp of related to technical courses.</b></h5>\n                    <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">Train all Technicians in the shortest time (6 months) at Basic level from Level 1- Level 3 to keep up with production needs.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\" item features-without-image mb-4 col-12 col-md-6\">\n                <div class=\"shadow bg-add2 item-wrapper align-center p-2 h-100\">\n                    <h5 class=\" card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\"><b>Insufficient Facilities during pick season</b></h5>\n                    <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">• Expanding the 4th floor at Training Center.<br>• Renovate, build more outside training building.<br></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\" item features-without-image mb-4 col-12 col-md-6\">\n                <div class=\"shadow bg-add3 item-wrapper align-center p-2 h-100\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\"><b>Trainers lacking pedaggogical</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">• Combine with outside Korean language centers &amp; invite university lecturers to directly participate in teaching.\n<br>• Expanding the Korean language contest, cultural exchange between Vietnam and Korea.\n<br>• Allowance policy to adjust Korean for those who reach TOPIK 4 and above.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image mb-4 col-12 col-md-6\">\n                <div class=\"shadow bg-add4 item-wrapper align-center p-2 h-100\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\"><b>Unique Styles</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">• Cooperate with the 3rd parties to invite trainers to teach Train the Trainer.\n<br>• Increase teaching fee for trainers based on the rule of time, experience and student assessment.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
