        "meta_descr": "Saint-Gobain is a global leader in construction materials and solutions, founded in France in 1665. Saint-Gobain Vietnam is a subsidiary of Saint-Gobain Group, offering a wide range of products and services for the construction industry under various brands, such as VINH TUONG, VINH TUONG-Gyproc, DURAflex, Weber, ISOVER, PAM, Vetrotech, Norton, Eurokera, ADFORS, SEKURIT12. Saint-Gobain Vietnam is committed to improving the quality of living and working spaces by providing innovative and sustainable solutions for life and the environment. Saint-Gobain’s mission is to make the world a better home",
